From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iwls <iwls@localhost>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 15:36:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Localize the app into Simplified Chinese

Localizable.xcstrings carries zh-Hans translations for the app's
interface (generated from the fork's madeira/l10n/zh-Hans.json), and
zh-Hans is the development region. Onboarding's header/primary/secondary
helpers take LocalizedStringKey so their titles are looked up, and the
library's, JIT setup's and Wine Mono's error and status messages go
through String(localized:). The local-network permission text is in
Chinese.
---
 app/Madeira.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj |    5 +
 app/Madeira/ContentView.swift         |   14 +-
 app/Madeira/Info.plist                |    4 +-
 app/Madeira/JITSetup.swift            |   30 +-
