 app/Madeira/Localizable.xcstrings     | 4426 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 app/Madeira/Onboarding.swift          |    6 +-
 app/Madeira/WineMono.swift            |   20 +-
 8 files changed, 4489 insertions(+), 58 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 app/Madeira/Localizable.xcstrings

